sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthorService
    participant AuthorRepository
    participant OptionalAuthor
    participant Author

    Client->>AuthorService: findById(id)
    Note right of Client: Client calls AuthorService.findById with author ID

    AuthorService->>AuthorRepository: findById(id)
    Note right of AuthorService: AuthorService calls repository.findById

    AuthorRepository->>OptionalAuthor: return OptionalAuthor
    Note right of AuthorRepository: Optional containing Author if found, empty otherwise

    alt Author is present in Optional
        OptionalAuthor->>AuthorService: return Author object
        Note right of OptionalAuthor: Author object returned

        AuthorService->>Client: return Author
        Note right of AuthorService: Author object returned to client
    else Author is absent in Optional
        OptionalAuthor->>AuthorService: throw ObjectNotFoundException
        Note right of OptionalAuthor: ObjectNotFoundException thrown when author not found

        AuthorService->>Client: ObjectNotFoundException propagates
        Note right of AuthorService: Exception propagates to caller
    end
